{
	"name": "Woodland Wisp",
	"type": "object",
	"img": "icons/magic/light/projectiles-trio-pink.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Some scholars posit that woodland wisps are related to the much more dangerous will-o’-the-wisp, though their curious rather than violent nature points to a different mode of origin. Whatever the method of their creation, woodland wisps are always found in wooded areas, where they blink and flit between the trees as Tiny balls of light.</p><p>Unless actively shooed away, woodland wisps will follow any humanoid through the woods at night, shedding bright light in a 5- foot radius and dim light for another 10 feet. Any Stealth checks made within the radius of this light are made at disadvantage.</p>",
